 --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2c1107ce-787d-4f61-a908-1b127e9ea5ee\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-aa6c7477-462f-4678-bdb2-ec6567df87bd\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c24dc437-8061-4cc5-b51b-567d6593ba28\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-aef58034-b08a-4be8-8684-ffb7e5e4ab7d\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8afa9dd2-5ef2-44e8-bd68-3e2c09571e1c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-63ea1f13-062f-45a5-a30a-fcd809a1d506\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-57561b38-ae95-43b7-b61a-1fc3143a8c3e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cc407730-8360-4148-ace5-feba8a150662\">·····················································································</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-20317a80-7673-4820-8bd2-5dbf8cacf79d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-150abcc4-2df3-40dc-a840-65929a33ff7a\"><b>📢 7/8(수) 무점검 업데이트 안내</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3c10a88e-54b7-416c-a574-84a8c3fea61f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2efdacf8-0ca0-4ebb-a27b-587e68c48cc5\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d3b2052d-1a8b-408b-8702-87a9eb6bbc16\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-de20f83c-b0d2-428b-96ea-e21ed2983a73\"><b>✔️ 일시</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7829802c-88f3-44d9-b60b-0246d8bed50f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2489a5a2-84c8-482a-98f7-f063ebd000ac\">- 7/8(수) 17:00 ~ 19:30 경</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-07d0b1ad-8feb-4aa7-82f5-e46032abfe9b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-78d5db5b-803e-472d-99d9-caa196c6b4f7\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7ae233f4-ead0-4071-9661-8910068471c5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3def78ed-6c35-4307-b5ec-7b3cda8c5b40\"><b>✔️ 내용</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b155e28c-37f5-409a-8cd7-08168c092273\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b007d3ac-42e8-40e1-93e2-ad3d1918d43f\">1. 풀 버스트 타임 시작 시 적용되는 일부 효과와 대상 스킬의 타이밍이 일치하도록 조정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-22e8ce59-6ef1-4fae-84f6-f4df61ef0ceb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5efb1650-31a7-40ef-a9da-db455893d52c\">[대상 스킬]</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-772dcf74-b534-4015-9e96-847f6af8fb64\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7c2fa5e3-8556-44b0-b635-6893897b072b\">└ 신데렐라 : 크리스탈 웨이브 저격 모드 버스트 스킬 「유리 구두 풀 컨텍트 W」</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0a707a2a-829e-4f4c-a939-4a45e272b231\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-27afa9cd-eda4-41b7-a79b-c412d377d132\">└ 브리드 : 사일런트 트랙 스킬1「기동」</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-81d6e57d-3766-4285-a7df-a64005edf93a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3db92753-f9fd-4b22-86f3-4e24b05fd4fe\">2. 신데렐라 : 크리스탈 웨이브가 버스트 스킬 「유리 구두 풀 컨텍트 W」사용과 동시에 무기 변경 시, 버스트 스킬 이펙트가 의도와 다르게 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b741c2de-1251-4096-97d9-39fc0038de2e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ddea4b76-d0e2-48b6-a813-e7440c616166\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e0ad6959-57be-4bbc-9ae5-32130feb3cac\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-54846bd9-3dd6-4b18-b9c4-cdfece5224a9\">※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1d326e3d-7187-4e1a-b5d8-d419a568bddf\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ad0df749-3fef-45ac-9c29-fd74a0865f6c\">※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b0e177fd-5a43-419d-a031-8fea702625fc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-05e11239-7d73-460b-8aa5-df2401d23c24\">·····················································································</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bf326a5f-2bb6-4c49-a137-187cc47e9ab7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2ce2dd07-b5be-4496-aa33-5108aeaf25f4\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --